  "selected_clauses": [
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 17.82,
      "end": 22.32,
      "text": "它是一件我从没有做过西装的一个感觉,它是这样的一个上威口的一个感觉。",
      "members": [
        3
      ],
      "group": 0,
      "role": "hook",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 22.64,
      "end": 26.42,
      "text": "它会把你整个人的脖颈这里有圆领的感觉,但是还有一个小威领的设计。",
      "members": [
        4
      ],
      "group": 0,
      "role": "hook",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 65,
      "start": 128.18,
      "end": 129.72,
      "text": "这件醋酸的小外套",
      "members": [
        65
      ],
      "group": 1,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "start": 61.38,
      "end": 64.52,
      "text": "它是用醋酸面料来做的没有用其他的任何面料",
      "members": [
        28,
        29
      ],
      "group": 1,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 68,
      "start": 133.16,
      "end": 134.08,
      "text": "微微弹力",
      "members": [
        68
      ],
      "group": 1,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 329,
      "start": 663.03,
      "end": 664.27,
      "text": "偏小一點這個外套",
      "members": [
        329
      ],
      "group": 1,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "start": 68.34,
      "end": 77.2,
      "text": "羊毛的话它会有黄白色因为羊毛无法漂白它只有那种奶奶的白所以这一件我要做的是那种纯白的感觉所以给大家做的是这样的一件面料",
      "members": [
        32,
        33,
        34,
        35,
        36
      ],
      "group": 2,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 143,
      "start": 312.3,
      "end": 315.82,
      "text": "肩膀这个地方它是可以很漂亮的给到你这个正肩感的",
      "members": [
        143
      ],
      "group": 3,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 29.8,
      "end": 31.56,
      "text": "它是收腰的同时它不夸张",
      "members": [
        7
      ],
      "group": 4,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 134,
      "start": 285.29,
      "end": 288.45,
      "text": "要腰伸有腰伸你腰粗的人穿上去秒变小S腰",
      "members": [
        134
      ],
      "group": 4,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 467,
      "start": 950.44,
      "end": 954.68,
      "text": "醋酸的面料是那种很薄的你现在空调房就能穿然后一直能穿到秋天",
      "members": [
        467,
        468,
        469
      ],
      "group": 5,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 465,
      "start": 947.3,
      "end": 948.92,
      "text": "他整个的版型是非常氧气的",
      "members": [
        465
      ],
      "group": 6,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 38.8,
      "end": 41.96,
      "text": "就非常的欧洲非常非常的法系的感觉",
      "members": [
        13,
        14
      ],
      "group": 6,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 392,
      "start": 787.72,
      "end": 789.64,
      "text": "它这个里面是这样的一个小V领的设计",
      "members": [
        392
      ],
      "group": 7,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "start": 59.22,
      "end": 61.38,
      "text": "我现在给的这个面料是马上立刻就能穿的",
      "members": [
        27
      ],
      "group": 8,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "start": 77.2,
      "end": 79.0,
      "text": "整个衣服又薄又有成度",
      "members": [
        37
      ],
      "group": 8,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 408,
      "start": 820.32,
      "end": 822.02,
      "text": "它穿在身上是不崩的",
      "members": [
        408
      ],
      "group": 8,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 284,
      "start": 589.27,
      "end": 591.53,
      "text": "你不要把它当外套你把它当件小衣服",
      "members": [
        284,
        285
      ],
      "group": 9,
      "role": "styling",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 276,
      "start": 574.64,
      "end": 578.7,
      "text": "你里面就随便整个小雕刀拉小背心拉你就穿这种小外套在空调房完全驾驭得了",
      "members": [
        276,
        277
      ],
      "group": 10,
      "role": "styling",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 479,
      "start": 983.88,
      "end": 985.7,
      "text": "这件小衣服我觉得就是搭个裤腿",
      "members": [
        479
      ],
      "group": 11,
      "role": "styling",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "start": 90.98,
      "end": 93.66,
      "text": "但是你上班你看你日常穿就搭一个裤腿西装裤",
      "members": [
        46,
        47
      ],
      "group": 12,
      "role": "styling",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "start": 94.92,
      "end": 98.6,
      "text": "小个子越要这样穿你穿这个裤腿配这种外套",
      "members": [
        49,
        50
      ],
      "group": 13,
      "role": "styling",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 463,
      "start": 941.64,
      "end": 943.88,
      "text": "我觉得你们搭扩扩扩什么的都挺好看的",
      "members": [
        463
      ],
      "group": 14,
      "role": "styling",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 283,
      "start": 586.82,
      "end": 589.27,
      "text": "然后去穿一个扣腿裤秋天的时候",
      "members": [
        283
      ],
      "group": 15,
      "role": "styling",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 398,
      "start": 801.68,
      "end": 803.38,
      "text": "很好看对吧你就搭裙子穿",
      "members": [
        398
      ],
      "group": 16,
      "role": "styling",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 321,
      "start": 651.41,
      "end": 653.27,
      "text": "其實你搭咱們家殺裙是真的很漂亮的",
      "members": [
        321
      ],
      "group": 17,
      "role": "styling",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 82,
      "start": 153.74,
      "end": 160.38,
      "text": "它是小薄型的白的黑的两个色黑色整个人你穿上去周是非常显瘦的白色超级气质",
      "members": [
        82,
        83,
        84
      ],
      "group": 18,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "start": 197.53,
      "end": 199.87,
      "text": "黑色其实你可以搭不一样的颜色的裤子可以搭灰的",
      "members": [
        102
      ],
      "group": 19,
      "role": "styling",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 487,
      "start": 996.98,
      "end": 999.54,
      "text": "白色可能会更加的让你感觉到有设计感一点",
      "members": [
